{"4966090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Angry Angry Shark 2", "steam_appid": 4966090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4974110], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966090/extras/b77bfd8d17709a3a69419ff58054b5a8.avif?t=1785143640\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sharks are back… bigger, faster, and angrier than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angry Angry Shark 2</strong> is the sequel to the fast-paced wave survival FPS. Fight through endless hordes of deadly man-eating sharks, unlock powerful weapons, customize your loadout, and survive for as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to three friends in online co-op as each wave becomes more intense than the last. Earn rewards, climb the leaderboards, and prove you have what it takes to survive the ultimate shark invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up with improved visuals, smoother gameplay, better weapon handling, and expanded customization, Angry Angry Shark 2 delivers everything fans enjoyed in the original—only bigger and better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4966090/extras/ef29387f7e90f8482a7504041e447381.avif?t=1785143640\" width=600 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >             <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share